<title>UK: France Telecom sets four billion Ffr bond.</title>
<headline>France Telecom sets four billion Ffr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Paribas and CNCA.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FRANCE TELECOM</p>
<p> AMT    4.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    25.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.780   PAY DATE   L07.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.3	 REOFFER    99.83     SPREAD	+14 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5	   GOV LAW     FRENCH</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.5 PCT APR 2007 OAT -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
